OL,3,AAndrew received #750,000 from Turkish
OL,4,Amillionaire, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Turkish millionaire has told the High
OL,7,FCourt she was misled over a #750,000
OL,8,Fpayment she made to Andrew
OL,9,FMountbatten-Windsor in 2019.
OL,11,FNebahat Isbilen is alleging her former
OL,12,Fbusiness adviser, Selman Turk,
OL,13,Fmisappropriated #38m of her assets,
OL,14,Fincluding a payment to the then-Duke of
OL,15,FYork which she believed was for help
OL,16,Fwith her passport.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
