OL,3,AAndrew received #750,000 from Turkish
OL,4,Amillionaire, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurk has rejected the allegations,
OL,7,Fsaying the 81-year-old Isbilen knew the
OL,8,Fmoney was actually being paid in the
OL,9,Fhope that Mountbatten-Windsor could
OL,10,Fhelp her husband, a politician who is
OL,11,Fin prison in Turkey.
OL,13,FMountbatten-Windsor repaid the #750,000
OL,14,Fand is expected to give evidence to the
OL,15,FHigh Court in December. He is not
OL,16,Faccused of any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
