OL,3,AIranian authorities flog singer who
OL,4,Aperformed without hijab, lawyers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prominent singer who performed
OL,7,Fwithout the mandatory hijab and four
OL,8,Fmembers of her band and production team
OL,9,Fhave been flogged by Iranian
OL,10,Fauthorities, lawyers say.
OL,12,FParastoo Ahmadi, three musicians and a
OL,13,Fproducer were each given 74 lashes in
OL,14,Fthe city of Qom, a member of their
OL,15,Fdefence team told the BBC.
OL,17,FAhmadi, 29, wore a sleeveless dress
OL,18,Fduring a concert that was livestreamed
OL,19,Fin December 2024. Iran's laws ban
OL,20,Fpublic performances by women and
OL,21,Frequire them to wear headscarves and
OL,22,Fmodest clothing.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
